                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Free copy for review here.\n\nThis is a basic sci-fi space robot wave shooter but in only 180 degrees not all sides. The game plays fine and looks good. Ammo and health drop as you play but not often enough for me. ;-) . You have to be accurate and things get hard fairly fast. It needs sound and graphics options and gun angle adjustment at the time of this writing. The price is a bit high right now for this kind of game if it will stay as it is now. Because I can't do a 50/50 I am saying positive for what it is. Boring for those who don't want wave shooters but for those who love these games and also leaderboards it is a go albeit simple. 5/10\n\nFirst game play here: \n\nhttps://gaming.youtube.com/watch?v=4iIx1AK2nms&feature=share",
